  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "승리 보상이 도착했어요!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9B9AC0020BCF4C0C1C7740020B3C4CC29D588C5B4C694002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승리한 포켓몬 트레이너에게\n<U+0010><U+0002>ĉ<U+0002><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0003> 도착했어요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9B9ACD55C0020D3ECCF13BAAC0020D2B8B808C774B108C5D0AC8C000A001000020109000200100002190000030020B3C4CC29D588C5B4C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승리 기념 선물이\n도착했어요!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9B9AC0020AE30B1500020C120BB3CC774000AB3C4CC29D588C5B4C694002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승리한 포켓몬 트레이너에게\n<U+0010><U+0002>ĉ<U+0002><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0003> 도착했어요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9B9ACD55C0020D3ECCF13BAAC0020D2B8B808C774B108C5D0AC8C000A001000020109000200100002190000030020B3C4CC29D588C5B4C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬을\n건강하게 해 드릴까요?<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACC744000AAC74AC15D558AC8C0020D5740020B4DCB9B4AE4CC694003F00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬을 건강하게 해 드릴게요!\n...이쪽은 제 전문이거든요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACC7440020AC74AC15D558AC8C0020D5740020B4DCB9B4AC8CC6940021000A002E002E002EC774CABDC7400020C81C0020C804BB38C774AC70B4E0C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "커피 한잔 어떠세요?<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CEE4D53C0020D55CC7940020C5B4B5A0C138C694003F00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬 승부로 지친 몸을 달래 줄\n최고의 커피를 드셔 보세요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B85C0020C9C0CE5C0020BAB8C7440020B2ECB7980020C904000ACD5CACE0C7580020CEE4D53CB97C0020B4DCC1540020BCF4C138C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "커피 한잔 하실래요?<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CEE4D53C0020D55CC7940020D558C2E4B798C694003F00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬용 블렌드랍니다.\n마시면 기운이 날 거예요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACC6A90020BE14B80CB4DCB78DB2C8B2E4002E000AB9C8C2DCBA740020AE30C6B4C7740020B0A00020AC70C608C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "누보 카페가 자랑하는\n커피 한잔 어떠니?<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B204BCF40020CE74D398AC000020C790B791D558B294000ACEE4D53C0020D55CC7940020C5B4B5A0B2C8003F00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "누보 카페가 자랑하는\n불대문자 로스트를 마시면<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n포켓몬도 건강해질 거야.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B204BCF40020CE74D398AC000020C790B791D558B294000ABD88B300BB38C7900020B85CC2A4D2B8B97C0020B9C8C2DCBA7400100001BE00000AD3ECCF13BAACB3C40020AC74AC15D574C9C80020AC70C57C002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "누보 카페가 자랑하는\n커피 한잔 어때?<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B204BCF40020CE74D398AC000020C790B791D558B294000ACEE4D53C0020D55CC7940020C5B4B54C003F00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "누보 카페의 비장의 메뉴\n불사르기 로스트면 포켓몬도 회복될 거야.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B204BCF40020CE74D398C7580020BE44C7A5C7580020BA54B274000ABD88C0ACB974AE300020B85CC2A4D2B8BA740020D3ECCF13BAACB3C40020D68CBCF5B4200020AC70C57C002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "보너스 카드를 줄게!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCF4B108C2A40020CE74B4DCB97C0020C904AC8C002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오늘 밤에 손에 넣은 카드 중에서\n너에게 한 장 나눠 줄게!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624B2980020BC24C5D00020C190C5D00020B123C7400020CE74B4DC0020C911C5D0C11C000AB108C5D0AC8C0020D55C0020C7A50020B098B2200020C904AC8C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "상금 메달을 받으라고!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0C1AE080020BA54B2ECC7440020BC1BC73CB77CACE0002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오늘 모은 메달인데\n전부 너에게 선물할게.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624B2980020BAA8C7400020BA54B2ECC778B370000AC804BD800020B108C5D0AC8C0020C120BB3CD560AC8C002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "상금 메달을 드릴까요?<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0C1AE080020BA54B2ECC7440020B4DCB9B4AE4CC694003F00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메달은 다음에 또 모으면 되니까\n저에게 승리한 당신께 전부 드리겠어요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54B2ECC7400020B2E4C74CC5D00020B6100020BAA8C73CBA740020B418B2C8AE4C000AC800C5D0AC8C0020C2B9B9ACD55C0020B2F9C2E0AED80020C804BD800020B4DCB9ACACA0C5B4C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "상금 메달을 주지!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0C1AE080020BA54B2ECC7440020C8FCC9C0002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나를 이긴 증표로 메달을 주겠어!\n유카리 님의 사랑도 담아서 말이야.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098B97C0020C774AE340020C99DD45CB85C0020BA54B2ECC7440020C8FCACA0C5B40021000AC720CE74B9AC0020B2D8C7580020C0ACB791B3C40020B2F4C544C11C0020B9D0C774C57C002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "상금 메달을\n갖고 싶으신가요?<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0C1AE080020BA54B2ECC744000AAC16ACE00020C2F6C73CC2E0AC00C694003F00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르 소셜 배틀 클럽에서는\n하룻밤 사이에 모은 메달의 수를<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n겨루고 있지만, 특별히 나눠 드리겠어요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B9740020C18CC15C0020BC30D2C00020D074B7FDC5D0C11CB294000AD558B8FBBC240020C0ACC774C5D00020BAA8C7400020BA54B2ECC7580020C218B97C00100001BE00000AACA8B8E8ACE00020C788C9C0B9CC002C0020D2B9BCC4D7880020B098B2200020B4DCB9ACACA0C5B4C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0001>\n상금 메달을 받았다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000010000219000001000AC0C1AE080020BA54B2ECC7440020BC1BC558B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0001>\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0008><U+0010><U+0002>ĉ<U+0002><U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0002> 손에 넣었다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 18,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000010000219000001000A00100002FF000008001000020109000200100002FF00000000100002190000020020C190C5D00020B123C5C8B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이차원 나무열매를\n선물로 드릴게요!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774CC28C6D00020B098BB34C5F4B9E4B97C000AC120BB3CB85C0020B4DCB9B4AC8CC694002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이차원 미르에서 모은\n<U+0010><U+0002>ĉ<U+0002><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0002> 선물로 드릴게요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774CC28C6D00020BBF8B974C5D0C11C0020BAA8C740000A001000020109000200100002190000020020C120BB3CB85C0020B4DCB9B4AC8CC69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이차원 나무열매는\n필요 없으세요?<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774CC28C6D00020B098BB34C5F4B9E4B294000AD544C6940020C5C6C73CC138C694003F00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "당신의 실력을 인정하는 뜻으로\n<U+0010><U+0002>ĉ<U+0002><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0002> 드릴게요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2F9C2E0C7580020C2E4B825C7440020C778C815D558B2940020B73BC73CB85C000A001000020109000200100002190000020020B4DCB9B4AC8CC69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬을\n회복시켜 드릴까요?<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACC744000AD68CBCF5C2DCCF1C0020B4DCB9B4AE4CC694003F00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "알 수 없는 이차원 미르에서도\n포켓몬을 건강하게 해 드릴게요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C54C0020C2180020C5C6B2940020C774CC28C6D00020BBF8B974C5D0C11CB3C4000AD3ECCF13BAACC7440020AC74AC15D558AC8C0020D5740020B4DCB9B4AC8CC69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이차원에서\n커피 한잔 어떠세요?<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774CC28C6D0C5D0C11C000ACEE4D53C0020D55CC7940020C5B4B5A0C138C694003F00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "신비한 이차원에서 마시는 커피가\n포켓몬을 건강하게 만들어 줄 거예요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2E0BE44D55C0020C774CC28C6D0C5D0C11C0020B9C8C2DCB2940020CEE4D53CAC00000AD3ECCF13BAACC7440020AC74AC15D558AC8C0020B9CCB4E4C5B40020C9040020AC70C608C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "커피 한잔 하실래요?<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CEE4D53C0020D55CC7940020D558C2E4B798C694003F00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이차원 블렌드랍니다.\n이유는 모르지만, 마시면 기운이 날 거예요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774CC28C6D00020BE14B80CB4DCB78DB2C8B2E4002E000AC774C720B2940020BAA8B974C9C0B9CC002C0020B9C8C2DCBA740020AE30C6B4C7740020B0A00020AC70C608C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "누보 카페가 자랑하는\n커피를 마셔 봐!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B204BCF40020CE74D398AC000020C790B791D558B294000ACEE4D53CB97C0020B9C8C1540020BD10002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어째서 내가 여기에 있는지 모르겠지만\n불대문자 로스트를 마시면<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n포켓몬도 건강해질 거야.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4C9F8C11C0020B0B4AC000020C5ECAE30C5D00020C788B294C9C00020BAA8B974ACA0C9C0B9CC000ABD88B300BB38C7900020B85CC2A4D2B8B97C0020B9C8C2DCBA7400100001BE00000AD3ECCF13BAACB3C40020AC74AC15D574C9C80020AC70C57C002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "누보 카페가 자랑하는\n커피를 마셔 봐!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B204BCF40020CE74D398AC000020C790B791D558B294000ACEE4D53CB97C0020B9C8C1540020BD10002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이차원에서도 누보 카페의 비장의 메뉴\n불사르기 로스트면 포켓몬이 회복될 거야.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 3052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774CC28C6D0C5D0C11CB3C40020B204BCF40020CE74D398C7580020BE44C7A5C7580020BA54B274000ABD88C0ACB974AE300020B85CC2A4D2B8BA740020D3ECCF13BAACC7740020D68CBCF5B4200020AC70C57C002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카드 대신 좋은 걸 줄게!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 3140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74B4DC0020B300C2E00020C88BC7400020AC780020C904AC8C002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>ĉ<U+0002><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0001>\n슈퍼 스페셜 레어한 거라고!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
