      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADC0C911D55C0020B3C4AD6CB97C0020BC1BC73CB77CACE0002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>ĉ<U+0002><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0001> 귀중한 도구지만\n나는 잔뜩 가지고 있어서 괜찮아.",
