      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이차원에 있는 MSBC도 인심은 후하다고.\n자, <U+0010><U+0002>ĉ<U+0002><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0002> 받아.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 3552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774CC28C6D0C5D00020C788B2940020004D005300420043B3C40020C778C2ECC7400020D6C4D558B2E4ACE0002E000AC790002C0020001000020109000200100002190000020020BC1BC544002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "멋진 것을 드릴까요?<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 3632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA4BC9C40020AC83C7440020B4DCB9B4AE4CC694003F00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이차원 레벨의 유카리 님의 사랑과 함께\n<U+0010><U+0002>ĉ<U+0002><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0002> 드리겠어요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 3684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774CC28C6D00020B808BCA8C7580020C720CE74B9AC0020B2D8C7580020C0ACB791ACFC0020D568AED8000A001000020109000200100002190000020020B4DCB9ACACA0C5B4C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "난 홀로그램이지만\n좋은 걸 줄게!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
